\\t\\t<!-- wp:buttons {\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"flex\\\",\\\"justifyContent\\\":\\\"center\\\"}} -->\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-buttons\\\"><!-- wp:button {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-button\\\"><a class=\\\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\\\">Subscribe<\\/a><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:button --><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:buttons -->\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<\\/aside>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n\",\"description\":\"A landing page for the book with a hero section, pre-order links, locations, FAQs and newsletter signup.\",\"viewport_width\":1400,\"categories\":[\"twentytwentyfive_page\",\"featured\"],\"keywords\":[\"starter\"],\"block_types\":[\"core\\/post-content\"],\"post_types\":[\"page\",\"wp_template\"]},{\"name\":\"twentytwentyfive\\/page-landing-event\",\"title\":\"Landing page for event\",\"content\":\"\\n<!-- wp:cover {\\\"url\\\":\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost:18281\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/twentytwentyfive\\/assets\\/images\\/northern-buttercups-flowers.webp\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Picture of a flower\\\",\\\"dimRatio\\\":10,\\\"isUserOverlayColor\\\":true,\\\"focalPoint\\\":{\\\"x\\\":0.5,\\\"y\\\":0.95},\\\"minHeight\\\":840,\\\"minHeightUnit\\\":\\\"px\\\",\\\"contentPosition\\\":\\\"bottom center\\\",\\\"align\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"padding\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\",\\\"left\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\",\\\"right\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\"},\\\"margin\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"0\\\"}}},\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"constrained\\\"},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"patternName\\\":\\\"twentytwentyfive\\/hero-full-width-image\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hero, full width image\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A hero with a full width image, heading, short paragraph and button.\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[\\\"banner\\\"]}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-cover alignfull has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-center\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);min-height:840px\\\">\\n\\t<span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-10 has-background-dim\\\"><\\/span>\\n\\t<img class=\\\"wp-block-cover__image-background\\\" alt=\\\"Picture of a flower\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost:18281\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/twentytwentyfive\\/assets\\/images\\/northern-buttercups-flowers.webp\\\" style=\\\"object-position:50% 95%\\\" data-object-fit=\\\"cover\\\" data-object-position=\\\"50% 95%\\\"\\/>\\n\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t<!-- wp:group {\\\"align\\\":\\\"wide\\\",\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"constrained\\\",\\\"justifyContent\\\":\\\"left\\\"}} -->\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-group alignwide\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:heading {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"fontSize\\\":\\\"xx-large\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-xx-large-font-size\\\">Tell your story<\\/h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>Like flowers that bloom in unexpected places, every story unfolds with beauty and resilience, revealing hidden wonders.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:buttons -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-buttons\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:button -->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-button\\\"><a class=\\\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\\\">Learn more<\\/a><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:button -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:buttons -->\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:cover -->\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"align\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"is-style-section-5\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"padding\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\"},\\\"margin\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"0\\\"}}},\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"constrained\\\"},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"patternName\\\":\\\"twentytwentyfive\\/heading-and-paragraph-with-image\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Heading and paragraph with image on the right\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A two-column section with a heading and paragraph on the left, and an image on the right.\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[\\\"about\\\"]}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-5\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\\\">\\n\\t<!-- wp:columns {\\\"align\\\":\\\"wide\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"blockGap\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|60\\\",\\\"left\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|80\\\"}}}} -->\\n\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-columns alignwide\\\">\\n\\t\\t<!-- wp:column {\\\"verticalAlignment\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"50%\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\\\" style=\\\"flex-basis:50%\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"wp-block-heading\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tAbout the event\\t\\t\\t<\\/h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"fontSize\\\":\\\"medium\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"has-medium-font-size\\\">Held over a weekend, the event is structured around a series of exhibitions, workshops, and panel discussions. The exhibitions showcase a curated selection of photographs that tell compelling stories from various corners of the globe, each image accompanied by detailed narratives that provide context and deeper insight into the historical significance of the scenes depicted. These photographs are drawn from the archives of renowned photographers, as well as emerging talents, ensuring a blend of both classical and contemporary perspectives.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:column -->\\n\\n\\t\\t<!-- wp:column {\\\"verticalAlignment\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"50%\\\",\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"default\\\"}} -->\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\\\" style=\\\"flex-basis:50%\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- wp:image {\\\"aspectRatio\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"scale\\\":\\\"cover\\\",\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"full\\\"} -->\\n\\t\\t\\t<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost:18281\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/twentytwentyfive\\/assets\\/images\\/ruins-image.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cliff Palace, Colorado\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\\\"\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/figure>\\n\\t\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:image -->\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<!-- \\/wp:column -->\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<!-- \\/wp:columns -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"align\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"margin\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"0\\\"}}},\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"constrained\\\"},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"patternName\\\":\\\"twentytwentyfive\\/banner-description-images-grid\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Banner with description and images grid\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A banner with a short paragraph, and two images displayed in a grid layout.\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[\\\"banner\\\",\\\"featured\\\"]}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group alignfull\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\\\">\\n\\t<!-- wp:group {\\\"align\\\":\\\"wide\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"padding\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\",\\\"bottom\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\"},\\\"blockGap\\\":\\\"var:preset|spacing|50\\\"}},\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"grid\\\",\\\"minimumColumnWidth\\\":\\\"26rem\\\"}} -->\\n\\t<div class=\\\"wp-block-group alignwide\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spa